M"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3332-4uk4ata","name":"4uk4ata","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T19:53:29-07:00","id":187601,"title":"","content":"Well if you have the messenger spell teh reasonably close Dragonblooded ally would be pretty reasonable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-05T05:40:40-07:00","id":188656,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>HaplessWithDice</b><br /> Soundless Forest looks good overall but there are some things:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">- We don't use the Sifu and Familiar backgrounds. A 3-dot Sifu is probably a 3-dot Mentor, but a 2-dot Familiar is probably a 1-dot Ally.<br /> - </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">In addition to Faction backing you should have Backing from a Directional Convention and from the Violet Bier. 1 each is enough. (Lucky Wei doesn't have Convention backing because he's a wastrel, but by default everyone should buy Backing 1 from their Division and from one of the Directional Conventions.)<br /> - </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">A Presence specialty in &quot;persuasion&quot; seems overly broad. When do you figure it would not apply?<br /> - </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">I don't understand your &quot;Philosophy&quot; Intimacies. The others are clear enough, but what does it mean to have an intimacy towards &quot;Death is a reprieve, not a punishment&quot;, or &quot;&quot;A sword is an extension of its bearer's soul&quot;? Not everything your character believes needs or ought to be represented as an Intimacy.</span><br /> <br /> <b>4uk4ata:</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there a way to ensure that a godblooded or dragonblooded ally with a landship can be reasonably close at hand on a short notice wherever we need to go? For example, can a god of crossroad inns move the inn from one crossroad to another? </div> </div> </div>A god or god-blooded could have a variant of Hurry Home that would work that way. A dragon-blooded not so much. You'll probably have to go to them rather than expect them to come halfway across the world to follow you. On the other hand, Sidereals have pretty awesome traveling capabilities, so even if your ally can't get to wherever you are, you can probably get to them on short notice.</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2082-schleiermacher","name":"Schleiermacher","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-05T18:42:59-07:00","id":189037,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Gentleman, behold!</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Name: Prismatic Lens</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Concept: Devoted yet Ambitious Seer</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Caste: Secrets</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Motivation: </b><i>To ascend the ranks of the Bureau of Destiny and eliminate the need for secrecy.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Intimacies: </b><i>Radiant Oasis (Sisterly Love), Chejop Kejak (Deep Respect), City of Kriss (Nostalgic Fondness), the Gods of the Bureau (Fanatic Devotion), Heaven (Religious Awe), Arrow-of-Time (Kinship and Gratefulness), Xaos the Hidden (Abiding Fascination and Friendship), the Maidens (Ultimate Loyalty).</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>General</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Compassion **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Temperance **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Conviction **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Valour ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Willpower *********</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Essence ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><i>Attributes</i></b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Strength ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Dexterity ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Stamina *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Charisma ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Manipulation **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Appearance *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Perception ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Intelligence ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Wits ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><i>Abilities</i></b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Resistance</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Ride</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Sail</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Survival</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Thrown</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Craft</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 (F) Dodge **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Linguistics *** (Languages: Flametongue, Riverspeak, Low Realm, Old Realm</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 (F) Performance *** (Specialty: Prayer +1)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Socialize **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 (F) Archery **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Athletics</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Melee</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Presence </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 War</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 (C) Investigation **** (Book-Work +1)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 (C) Larceny ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 (C) Lore **** (Supernatural +1)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 (C) Occult **** (Astrology +1)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 (C) Stealth ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 (F) Awareness ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Bureaucracy **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Integrity *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Martial Arts **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2022 Medicine</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><i>Backgrounds</i></b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Acquaintances ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>1. Radiant Oasis: Lens' sister, a Guild merchant with connections throughout the Inner Sea. Remembers Lens as her Sister, but can never recall anything about her when she isn't around. Trades primarily in the unique clockwork machinery that Varang is known for.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>2. Cult of the Stars: Lens has always had a place in the Cult of the Stars that is so important to Varang. As a Sidereal, she retains many of her beliefs and works hard to maintain her connections with the Cult. </i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Manse<i> ***</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>The Temple of Emerald Light: A large Manse built by Lens' prior incarnation - Light-of-Knowledge - located in the Lunargent Ecological Protectorate. It appears to be made out of green glass, gold and black marble - it sits in the middle of a garden of cherry-blossoms.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>The Manse is both a temple to Jupiter and a sprawling public library - additionally, there is a considerable private archive hidden alongside the Hearthroom behind a mural depicting the Pattern-Spiders at work on the third floor. </i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><i>The library is usually kept by her servants.</i></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Contacts **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Xaos the Hidden: Lens considers herself a friend of Xaos, one of the only powerful Gods in the Bureau she had not heard of through the Cult of the Stars' scripture. She is -fascinated- in this God and has learned so many things from him. </i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Luckily she has yet to see behind his veil or be afflicted by the madness that befalls those who hear too many of Xaos' secrets - as far as she knows, at least. Links to Yu-Shan.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Lens also has connections to the Guild through one Golden-Sea, a merchant prince who operates primarily in the Inner Sea and is Radiant Oasis' superior. He primarily trades in firedust and Djala slaves.</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Artifact **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Wings of Destiny: A Short Starmetal Powerbow left by Arrow-of-Time, a Chosen of Battles and blood-brother of Light-of-Knowledge who took pains to ensure Lens lived a good life on Creation before Exaltation - when </i><b><i>his</i></b><i> successor is revealed, Lens hopes to be his mentor.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>The Powerbow looks almost like a small set of ornate wings made of Starmetal and multicoloured glass; indeed, it can be worn on the back so as to appear such, or be folded so as to be easily hidden.</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Salary ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Backing * (Forbidding Manse of Ivy - Southern Convention)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><i>Colleges</i></b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Key **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Sorcerer *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Treasure Trove *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Mask ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><i>Charms</i></b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Absence (Sidereals 143, Errata 63)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Generalised Ammunition Technique (Sidereals 151, Errata 67)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Efficient Secretary Technique (Sidereals 162, Errata 72)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Research Assistant Invocation (Sidereals 163, Errata 72)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Embracing-Life Method (Sidereals 163, Errata 73)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Name-Pilfering Practice (Sidereals 164, Errata 73)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Methodology of Secrets (Sidereals 166)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Of the Shape of the World (Sidereals 167, Errata 73)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Of Things Desired and Feared (Sidereals 168, Errata 73)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Mark of Exaltation (Sidereals 169, Errata 73)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Tell-Tale Symphony (Sidereals 169, Errata 73)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Wise Choice (Sidereals 174)</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Health Levels:</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>1x -0</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>2x -1</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>2x -2</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>1x -4</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Incapacitated</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Dying</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><i>Combat Block</i></b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Personal Essence: 13/15</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Peripheral Essence: 36/36</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Committed: 2 (Short Powerbow)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Willpower: 9/9</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">DDV: 5</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PDV: 4</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MDV: 6</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Soak</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><i>0A/0L/1B Natural</i></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Yeah, I think I've got everything right here.<br /> So yeah, finally done and checked in.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":203,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","user":"Kleptomania","date":". 07-06-2014, 01:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T16:03:14-07:00","id":189685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Schleiermacher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/180713-ooc-should-the-sun-not-rise-sidereals-2-5?p=188656#post188656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A god or god-blooded could have a variant of Hurry Home that would work that way. A dragon-blooded not so much. You'll probably have to go to them rather than expect them to come halfway across the world to follow you. On the other hand, Sidereals have pretty awesome traveling capabilities, so even if your ally can't get to wherever you are, you can probably get to them on short notice.</div> </div> </div> </div>My idea was to have a landship, possibly temporarily seconded to an ally (until I get the right charms <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) modified to work as a bar, both for the coolness factor and as a mobile base of operations. The thing is, unless it is also a folding boat (which means 5-dot artifact straight from get-go) it is a bit tricky to have around whever you need to be and would require an operator and crew in Creation proper. There is probably some sidereal trick to help people think this weird tavern out the city limits proper has always been there - and if not, well, landships happen. The problem was how to ensure it is in position quickly enough if we need to get across creation in a hurry, and how reliable it would be if it were in the hands of an ally.<br /> <br /> Edit: BTW, how quick is a landship normally?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3332,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3332-4uk4ata","user":"4uk4ata","date":". 07-06-2014, 07:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3332-4uk4ata","name":"4uk4ata","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T16:56:08-07:00","id":189702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Schleiermacher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/180713-ooc-should-the-sun-not-rise-sidereals-2-5?p=188656#post188656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>HaplessWithDice</b><br /> Soundless Forest looks good overall but there are some things:</span><br /> [FONT=Calibri]<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">- We don't use the Sifu and Familiar backgrounds. A 3-dot Sifu is probably a 3-dot Mentor, but a 2-dot Familiar is probably a 1-dot Ally.<br /> - </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">In addition to Faction backing you should have Backing from a Directional Convention and from the Violet Bier. 1 each is enough. (Lucky Wei doesn't have Convention backing because he's a wastrel, but by default everyone should buy Backing 1 from their Division and from one of the Directional Conventions.)<br /> - </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">A Presence specialty in &quot;persuasion&quot; seems overly broad. When do you figure it would not apply?<br /> - </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">I don't understand your &quot;Philosophy&quot; Intimacies. The others are clear enough, but what does it mean to have an intimacy towards &quot;Death is a reprieve, not a punishment&quot;, or &quot;&quot;A sword is an extension of its bearer's soul&quot;? Not everything your character believes needs or ought to be represented as an Intimacy.</span></div> </div> </div> </div>- Changed Sifu to Mentor, the Sifu background is just a mentor who knows one or more martial arts style and teaches them to the characters.<br /> - Dropped Familiar for backing in the Convention on Deathlords and Convention of Air, Adjusted standing with Bronze faction to increase standing with Convection on Deathlords. Someone who's motivation is to assassinate the Deathlords one at a time probably is involved with that department.<br /> - Changed Presence speciality from Persuasion which I agree does sound broad, to Interrogation or &quot;Enhanced Persuasion&quot;<br /> - A Philosophy intimacy is a defining philosophy that guides his actions and attitudes as a whole as much as love for a person, or place does. Someone who has an intimacy to a philosophy like &quot;Sword is an extension of its bearer's soul&quot; can be have that attitude discovered and manipulated by others like any other intimacy and even used against or for him. For example destroying another sidreal's weapon or stealing it in order to send a message to them. &quot;Death is a reprieve, not a punishment&quot; the same way can be used to justify to him to kill someone or spare their life. Remember the passionate plea of Cora from Dragonheart to prince Hinerick? &quot;Please let my father go. Your castle is built, and he has suffered much already and was even blinded. Hasn't he suffered enough? Please let him go!&quot; To which the Prince shoots him though the heart and kills him. responding &quot;Your right. As I said all those days ago. Death is a release not a punishment.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T19:45:21-07:00","id":193011,"title":"","content":"Just checking in...<br /> Umm...Everything okay?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T04:47:37-07:00","id":194544,"title":"","content":"Yeah, sorry, had some finishing touches to make yet work and SWTOR keep taking more time than I expected. Will be done pretty soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3332-4uk4ata","name":"4uk4ata","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T00:59:22-07:00","id":195321,"title":"","content":"Alright. We will be waiting to see who you will be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><