ame":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T14:46:09-07:00","id":198242,"title":"","content":"Ok, so here is my draft for a character, I still have some issues that I am considering (i.e. if the landship should technically be mine or my ally's)<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Name: The Carrier of Flowing Wisdom, Federiko Caloa a.k.a. Barkeep</b><br /> <b>Concept:</b> the barkeep who listens to everyone \u2013 and everyone listens to.<br /> <b>Caste: Serenity</b><br /> <b>Motivation: </b><i>To ensure Creation gets a next golden age \u2013 and it is forged partly due to his efforts</i><br /> <b>Intimacies: </b><i>Stories (passion), Port Cabrast (Nostalgia), Gods and Exalts of the Cerulean Lute (amused interest) Elders (wary respect), Shaori(Affection), oblivion cultists/servants (loathing and a little fear), Immaculate Faith (caution), the exalted and gods of the Jupiterday Callisto Club (exhausted camaraderie), The Moored Dream (pride)</i><br /> <br /> <b>General</b><br /> \u2022 Compassion ***<br /> \u2022 Temperance **<br /> \u2022 Conviction **<br /> \u2022 Valour **<br /> \u2022 Willpower *******<br /> \u2022 Essence ***<br /> <br /> <b><i>Attributes</i></b><br /> \u2022 Strength **<br /> \u2022 Dexterity ****<br /> \u2022 Stamina ***<br /> \u2022 Charisma ***<br /> \u2022 Manipulation *****<br /> \u2022 Appearance ***<br /> \u2022 Perception ***<br /> \u2022 Intelligence **<br /> \u2022 Wits **<br /> <b><i>Abilities</i></b><br /> \u2022 (F)Resistance *<br /> \u2022 Ride<br /> \u2022 Sail *<br /> \u2022 Survival<br /> \u2022 Thrown<br /> \u2022 \u00a9 Craft (water) *** (brewing +1)<br /> \u2022 \u00a9 Dodge ***<br /> \u2022 \u00a9 Linguistics ** (Languages: Seatongue, Low Realm, Old Realm)<br /> \u2022 \u00a9 Performance ***<br /> \u2022 \u00a9Socialize ***** (trustworthy +2)<br /> \u2022 Archery *<br /> \u2022 Athletics<br /> \u2022 Melee<br /> \u2022 Presence **<br /> \u2022 War<br /> \u2022 (F) Investigation *<br /> \u2022 Larceny<br /> \u2022 Lore ***<br /> \u2022 Occult **<br /> \u2022 Stealth *<br /> \u2022 (F) Awareness *<br /> \u2022 Bureaucracy **<br /> \u2022 Integrity *<br /> \u2022 (F) Martial Arts **** (blunt weapons)<br /> \u2022 Medicine**<br /> <b><i>Backgrounds</i></b><br /> <br /> Acquaintances **<br /> <i>1. Silvered Fox, mostly legitimate trader captain based in the northern ports</i><br /> <i>2. The regulars of the Sullen Mother, a tavern in a Coral Archipelago port close to the seat of the Western Convention</i><br /> <br /> Manse<i> **</i><br /> <i>The Veranda of Soft Sorrows: A medium-sized manse in Yu-shan, apparently favored by a previous incarnation (for whatever reason) with a small attached apartment. It is surprisingly simple, though quite comfortable, and offers an impressive view on a part of the Heavenly City. While somewhat isolated for Federico\u2019s usually gregarious nature, it is great when he is feeling more melancholic, scheming, or just wants a scenic vista for a tryst. The green and white jade colonnade is mostly hidden by vines crawling up the front of the building. (Hearthstone: Pearl of Wisdom, +2 dice when channeling Compassion/temperance, -2 on valor/conviction OR deep drink, immunity to all imbibed venoms OR holiness, +1 </i>to any Manipulation or Charisma rolls to gain trust or convince someone of her honesty (+1 more) OR Celestial Mandarin, stone reduces thediffi culty of all Social rolls the bearer\u2019s player uses on gods/demons/elementals by 2 (to a minimum diffi culty of 1<i> )</i><br /> <br /> <br /> Contacts *****<br /> Realm fleet ** (mostly western)<br /> North * (Port Cabrast-based merchants and mercenaries)<br /> Yu-Shan ** (as an employee and regular in the Cerulean Lute, Federiko has occasionally chatted up plenty of gods and others who frequent them, and is known enough for his discretion that a few open up to him with ideas they don\u2019t want many other people to know \u2013 or ones they want other people to know, but not as coming from them)<br /> <br /> Artifact **+***<br /> <i>Peacekeeper \u2013 an artifact wrackstaff which can contract to the size of a small and seemingly regular baton</i><br /> <i>The moored Dream \u2013 a landship, currently in the command of a subordinate, refitted for a bar and often used during extended missions</i><br /> <br /> Salary **<br /> <br /> Backing * (Cerulean Lute), ** (Western Convention)<br /> Allies: * (minor god at bureau, affiliated with Western Taverns),** Shaori of Zephyr Cove (dragonblooded outcaste, currently at the helm of the Dream, a good friend and occasionally more)<br /> Mentor: *** (an elder, somewhat strange elder CoJourneys that tends to occasionally show in Federiko\u2019s tavern, wherever that is, can drink most Beasts of Resplendent Liquids under the table and always has crazy stories \u2013 and occasionally time.<br /> Followers * (personnel of the Moored Dream)<br /> Resources *** (from backing, usually invested in a mission or in the upkeep of the Moored Dream and whatever plans Shaori has about its development<br /> <br /> <b><i>Colleges</i></b><br /> <br /> The Ship's Wheel**<br /> The Pillar***<br /> The Ewer *<br /> The Guardian *<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><i>Charms</i></b><br /> <br /> <br /> 2<sup>nd</sup> excellency \u2013 MA , socialize, craft<br /> Excellent implem. Of obj<br /> Heart-brightening presentation<br /> Absence<br /> Duck fate<br /> Efficient secretary<br /> Favorable inflection procedure<br /> Shun the smiling lady<br /> Cash &amp; murder games<br /> Fortuitious fellowship<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Health Levels:</b><br /> <i>1x -0</i><br /> <i>2x -1</i><br /> <i>2x -2</i><br /> <i>1x -4</i><br /> <i>Incapacitated</i><br /> <i>Dying</i><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Ok, so since I am a bit newish, especially to sidereals, I'd appreciate some advice, especially when it comes to astrology... can I do anything without a fair few dots in craft fate?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3332,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3332-4uk4ata","user":"4uk4ata","date":". 07-15-2014, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3332-4uk4ata","name":"4uk4ata","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T18:06:38-07:00","id":198391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>4uk4ata</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/180713-ooc-should-the-sun-not-rise-sidereals-2-5?p=198242#post198242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, so since I am a bit newish, especially to sidereals, I'd appreciate some advice, especially when it comes to astrology... can I do anything without a fair few dots in craft fate?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm new to Sids too, but from what I understand you don't need any dots in Craft Fate to carry or wear Resplendent Destinies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T18:52:12-07:00","id":198449,"title":"","content":"Likewise this is my first Sid ever.<br /> I did notice though that they get Martial Arts charms for reduced XP (8xp per charm if MA is caste/favored 10xp for none favored). I found that interesting and helps to emphasize them as the martial arts masters because their native charms are harder to get but martial arts are easier.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=